Package: lxc-hotplug-guest
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7)
Maintainer: LXC Hotplug Team <support@example.com>
Description: LXC USB Hotplug Guest Agent for Privileged LXC Containers
 Daemon running inside privileged LXC container that mirrors host USB devices
 from /dev/.lxc/dev to container /dev using mknod and provides debounce timers.
